    "title": "Crime Stoppers: 2 wanted for armed robbery - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shajaka Shelton ,\n1 hours ago LANSING, Mich. (WLNS) — This week on Crime Stoppers, police need your help tracking down two individuals wanted for armed robbery out of Jackson County.\nThe suspects are:\nRitchie Louis Jiminez , 24, who is 5’7″ and 168 lbs., with black hair and brown eyes. James Dion Goodall , 25, who is 6′ and 190 lbs. with black hair and brown eyes. If you have information regarding this case call Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan at (517) 483-STOP. You can remain anonymous.\nThose who contact Crime Stoppers with information can receive up to a $1,000 award.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WLNS 6 News.",
